      <guid isPermaLink="false">2026-10-24-Release-HFD</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>HFD is a desktop app framework built entirely in-house: a Go runtime on GTK3 + WebKitGTK, a zero-dependency TypeScript CLI, and type-safe bindings. No Wails, no Tauri, no Electron. v0.2.0 is out for Linux.</description>
